<title>JAPAN: Nippon Mining '96/97 parent current profit rises.</title>
<headline>Nippon Mining '96/97 parent current profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		229.14		vs	  226.59</p>
<p> Operating	   16.15		vs	   11.59</p>
<p> Current	     13.85		vs	    7.74</p>
<p> Net		    7.27		vs	    3.84</p>
<p> EPS		   36.33 yen	  vs	   19.18 yen</p>
<p> Shares		 200,000	   vs	 200,000</p>
<p> Ord div		5,000 yen	 vs	    nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Nippon Mining and Metals Corp, Japan's largest copper smelter. It is not listed on bourses.</p>
<p>TOKYO, May 27 (Reuter) -</p>
